# Platform

The diagram above shows the platform. The web app calls the order service, and the order service reads from the orders database and publishes to the message bus.

```plantuml
@startuml
component "Web app" as W
component "Order service" as O
database "Orders database" as D
queue "Message bus" as M
W --> O
O --> D
O --> M
@enduml
```

The message bus then delivers events to subscribers, and the web app refreshes its view from the order service.
